      "type": "understanding",
      "summary": "Agent explained goal and mechanics.",
      "understanding": {
        "goal_understanding": "Navigate the grid to activate and then step onto all goal cells in each level. A goal cell is completed only when the carried piece exactly matches that goal\u2019s required shape, color, and rotation at the moment you step on it. Completing all goals advances to the next level; completing all levels wins the game.",
        "mechanics_understanding": "Each turn you choose a movement action (e.g., MOVE_NORTH/SOUTH/EAST/WEST). Movement can be blocked by walls, in which case your position does not change. Moving costs stamina; reaching 0 stamina costs a life, and losing all lives ends the game. Stepping on modifier tiles changes the carried piece\u2019s attributes: shape modifiers cycle the shape, color modifiers cycle the color, and rotation modifiers rotate the piece 90\u00b0 clockwise. The game provides feedback on which goal requirements are mismatched and may point to relevant modifier tile locations; once the piece matches a goal, you must physically move onto that goal cell to complete it."
      }
